it's the next left


00:03:36.599 --> 00:03:38.135
<i>about three miles up.</i>


00:03:39.437 --> 00:03:41.138
<i>You're traveling light.</i>


00:03:41.172 --> 00:03:43.707
<i>Yeah, just here for
