00:04:01.025 --> 00:04:03.060
<i>I don't know, mate.
That sounds like something</i>


00:04:03.094 --> 00:04:04.895
<i>you should've pre-planned,
don't you think?</i>


00:04:04.929 --> 00:04:06.030
<i>Right.</i>


00:04:10.234 --> 00:04:11.634
