00:08:42.773 --> 00:08:44.475
We got last
known location.


00:08:48.345 --> 00:08:49.480
Let's move.


00:09:10.734 --> 00:09:13.470
Kate Taylor.
I'm the director here.


00:09:13.504 --> 00:09:14.905
Nice to meet you,
Miss Taylor.


00:09:14.938 --> 00:09:17.708
