Mr. Michaels.


00:09:23.914 --> 00:09:25.416
Well, if you're Kate
then I'm Paul.


00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.885
Fair enough.


00:09:27.918 --> 00:09:29.820
I've heard a lot
